The '''Tipoca City Military Complex''' was the primary facility that the [[Kaminoan]] [[Cloning|cloners]] used for the production and training of the [[Grand Army of the Republic]]. It was located within [[Kamino]]'s [[capital]] of [[Tipoca City]].<ref name="AOTC" />

==Layout==
The [[Tipoca City]] Military Complex contained an array of facilities, including the [[Central Armory]],<ref name="USW" /> the [[Genetic Records Hall]], the [[Tipoca City embryo room|embryo room]],<ref name="Fugitive" /> a [[Tipoca City Training Facility|training course]] for tests including the [[Citadel Challenge]],<ref name="Clone Cadets" /> the [[Tipoca City cafeteria|cafeteria]],<ref name="Aftermath" /> the [[clone DNA room]], and the [[Egg Lab]]. Various [[hangar]]s and [[barracks]] were also located there,<ref name="ARC Troopers" /> including the [[Bad Batch barracks|barracks]] used by [[Clone Force 99]].<ref name="Aftermath" />

